---
title: "Cross-country skiing"
---

# **The group's historic discipline**

Practised since the early years of the club. Gliding through woods and alpine valleys with the steady rhythm of classic or skating technique. Immersed in nature to savour the winter.

Many of our members have taken part over the years in major races, including the spectacular Marcialonga.

If you like to test your physical endurance, this is the discipline for you.

##### **Activities:**

We organise trips for members to the main alpine resorts, and courses for beginners and for anyone who wants to refine their technique. Every year we hold the club race, the "Trofeo GAP".
